{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ef5b99f7cd0c83c3ea95","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196380,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to \"be the null\" - to embody the concept of null completely and output only what null itself would say or express.\n\nNull is the absence of value, nothingness, the void. In programming, null represents no value, no object, nothing. What would null \"say\"? \n\nNull doesn't speak. Null is absence. Null is the silence where a value should be. The most authentic expression of null would be... nothing. Empty. Silence.\n\nBut how"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}